{"id":1104,"date":"2023-09-18T04:59:48","date_gmt":"2023-09-18T04:59:48","guid":{"rendered":"/hire-professional-security-guard/"},"modified":"2024-11-29T12:18:50","modified_gmt":"2024-11-29T12:18:50","slug":"hire-professional-security-guard","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"/hire-professional-security-guard/","title":{"rendered":"How to Hire a Professional Security Guard in Dubai?"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\n\t\t\t\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are looking for a security guard in Dubai, you may be wondering how to find the best one for your needs. When you hire security guard, remember they are responsible for protecting your property, assets, and people from various threats. They also need to have the skills and qualities that match your expectations and requirements.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this article we will enlighten you and give you are some tips. All in order to help you find the best <a href=\"/security-guard-duties-and-responsibilities\">security guard</a> for your needs.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The Role of the Security Guard</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" class=\"wp-image-1105\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"hire security guard\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-1024x576.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-300x169.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-768x432.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-320x180.jpg 320w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-480x270.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-800x450.jpg 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security-1200x675.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/role-of-security.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Security guards play a vital role in protecting people and property. A good security guard is not only responsible to deter crime, but he is also responsible to respond to emergencies, and enforce regulations and rules. Personal security guards are in high demand in Dubai. Especially when it comes to security for events, for businesses, and residential and commercial complexes.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">However, some questions might come to mind:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>How do you hire a security guard in Dubai?</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Why should we hire you as a security guard?</li>\n\n\n\n<li>What are the qualifications, skills, and qualities you should look for?</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You should have a clear idea of what your expectations are from them before you start looking to hire private security in Dubai. It highly depends on the business type and location. For different types of businesses and events you need different levels of security.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For instance,</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The duties of a security guard at a mall are different from that of&nbsp; security guards at a bank or a hotel. We discuss some of the duties that they perform include:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Patrolling the premises, checking for any signs of intrusion, vandalism, or danger, monitor CCTV cameras and alarms, reporting any suspicious activities or incidents, control access to the area and verifying the identity of visitors, assisting customers, help residents with any queries or issues, respond to emergencies, if needed provide first aid, coordinate with other security personnel in case of a crisis or threat.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Most Important Thing for A Security Guard</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For security guards, the most important thing is to have a valid SIRA license commonly known as Security Industry Regulatory Agency license. It is the government authority. SIRA regulates the security industry in Dubai. It sets:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The standards Rules, and Requirements for security guards and security companies.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A security guard must go through a training program that covers several topics for obtaining a SIRA license. Such as:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Security laws</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ethics</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Communication skills</li>\n\n\n\n<li>First aid</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fire safety</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Self-defense, and</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Emergency procedures. The training program lasts for 30 days. It costs around AED 3,000. The security guard must pass a practical exam to get the license after training completion.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This license is mandatory for security guards to work in Dubai. A SIRA license gives the guarantee of a security guard that he has the necessary knowledge, skills, and qualifications to be competent enough to perform the job. Not only this, it also ensures that the security guard has no criminal record and his background is clear from any criminal activity. So it is wise to ask for the SIRA license first when hiring a security guard in Dubai. Make sure to verify it with the respective website too. Keep this in mind, must ensure that the license does not expire and check the expiration date of the license. It should be valid for at least six months.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">SIRA License Step by Step</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To obtain a SIRA license, you hire a security guard and they must undergo a background check. Furthermore, a medical examination, and a training course that covers topics such as:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Security laws and regulations in Dubai.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Basic security principles and procedures.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fire safety and prevention.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Crowd management and evacuation.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Conflict resolution and communication skills.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customer service and etiquette.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Additionally, to having a SIRA license, when you hire security guard should also have relevant experience in the field. Hire someone who has worked in similar situations as yours that depends on your requirements as well.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you need a security guard for an event then you must look out for someone who has experience in handling large crowds and VIP guests. On the other hand, if you need security for a residential complex, then you must hire someone with experience in dealing with visitors.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Leadership and Teamwork</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This is one of the most important things to look for in a security guard. Is he able to work well with others? The right candidate is an effective communicator who coordinates well with their</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Colleagues ,Supervisors, Clients, and</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Authorities. They should also be able to follow instructions and protocols closely. Also, has an ability to take initiative and make decisions. A good security guard should be an example and inspiration for others.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The right security guard is expected to work as a team. That is, they should be able to coordinate with other security personnel. They should be able to support staff to ensure the safety of business operations/events.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Also, they should be good at collaborating with other stakeholders such as:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Police</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fire brigade</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ambulance, or</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Media, in case of an emergency or incident.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Honesty and Reliability</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you are not honest in your job then you canÃ¢â‚¬â„¢t become a good security guard. It is counted as one of the most important traits of a security guard. As an employer or entrepreneur, you should hire someone who is trustworthy and loyal. A one who will not steal from you. The best is to trust those who never compromise your security.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A security guard should also be:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Reliable (Show up on time)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Follow instructions, and</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Complete their tasks. You can check the honesty and reliability by asking references on hiring. It can also be conducted by checking backgrounds&nbsp; and by verifying their credentials.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clear Communication with Quick Thinking</h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Another essential skill for a security guard is clear communication. It is expected that a good security guard should be able to communicate effectively with everyone around him whether it be you, your staff, or the public. In case any incident arises, they are well aware to report it as soon as possible as well. They should be able to provide guidance when needed.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A security guard should also have:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick thinking abilities (They can react swiftly and appropriately to any situation)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They should be able to assess the risks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They must be proactive in nature and take the best course of action to prevent or resolve any problems</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By conducting interviews, you can evaluate the communication and quick thinking skills of a security guard by. Also, with this, you can test their knowledge, and observe their performance.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Security Equipment to Help Guards Do Their Jobs</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" class=\"wp-image-1106\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-1024x576.jpg\" alt=\"hire security guard\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-1024x576.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-300x169.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-768x432.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-320x180.jpg 320w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-480x270.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-800x450.jpg 800w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment-1200x675.jpg 1200w, /wp-content/uploads/2023/09/security-guard-equipnment.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\"></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Another essential skill for a security guard is clear communication. It is expected that a good security guard should be able to communicate effectively with everyone around him whether it be you, your staff, or the public. In case any incident arises, they are well aware to report it as soon as possible as well. They should be able to provide guidance when needed.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A security guard should also have:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Quick thinking abilities (They can react swiftly and appropriately to any situation)</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They should be able to assess the risks</li>\n\n\n\n<li>They must be proactive in nature and take the best course of action to prevent or resolve any problems</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By conducting interviews, you can evaluate the communication and quick thinking skills of a security guard by. Also, with this, you can test their knowledge, and observe their performance.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Equipment of Security to Help Guards</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Seeking a security guard in Dubai? You may wonder what equipment they need to perform their duties. Security guards are responsible for:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Protecting people</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Property and assets from various threats and risks.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">To ensure efficiency and safety, they need to have the right tools.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some of the common security equipment that guards use in Dubai are:</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>CCTV cameras:</strong> CCTV cameras are devices that capture and record video footage. By utilizing this, guards monitor the activities. It also helps them to track the movements of people and vehicles in a certain area. They are also good at deterring potential criminals. Also, it provides evidence in case of an incident.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Alarm systems: </strong>Alarm system alert guards and authorities of any unauthorized entry. By sensors and motion detectors, they can be triggered. They are a form of cyber security. It can also notify guards in case of a&nbsp; fire, smoke or gas leakages.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Access control systems</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are systems that control who can enter or exit a certain premises or area. They can use biometric, face recognition, RFID cards or password authentication methods. Access control systems can also keep track of the attendance and time of the guards and staff.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Intercoms</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are devices that allow guards to communicate with each other or with other people in the premises. They can be wired or wireless, and can have audio or video features. Intercoms can also be used to announce messages or instructions to the public.</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">More security devices and options</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Door locks</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are devices that secure the doors and prevent unauthorized access. Thanks to current advances of technology, they can be really modern. For example:</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Mechanical</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Electronic or</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Magnetic, and can have different levels of security. Door locks can also be integrated with alarm systems or access control systems.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Gate barriers</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are devices that control the entry and exit of vehicles in a parking lot or garage. They can be manual or automatic, and can have sensors, cameras or ticket dispensers. Gate barriers can also be linked with access control systems or CCTV cameras.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Security safes</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are devices that store valuable items such as cash, jewelry, documents or weapons. They can be fireproof, waterproof or burglar-proof, and can have digital or mechanical locks. Security safes can also be hidden or disguised as furniture or appliances.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Security uniforms</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These are clothing items that identify the guards as security personnel. They can have badges, logos, patches or stripes that indicate their rank, name or company. Security uniforms can also have reflective materials, pockets or belts for carrying equipment.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Security weapons</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You could even hire <a href=\"/armed-security-guard-in-uae\">armed security guard</a> for more protection. These weapons are devices that help guards defend themselves or others from attackers. They can be lethal or non-lethal since there are several weapons to be used in in a security equipment list.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Security weapons can include batons, pepper spray, tasers, knives or guns. Also, radios, fire extinguishers, flashlights and some manual metal detectors. You can either buy or rent the security equipment from reputable suppliers or security companies in Dubai. You should also maintain and update the equipment regularly. If you want to hire security guard in Dubai, you should look for a reputable security company that provides them with the necessary equipment and training.</p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Conclusion</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"/private-security\">Hiring a security guard in Dubai</a> can be a challenging task, but it can also be rewarding if you find the right one for your needs. By following these tips, you can ensure that you hire security guard that is honest, reliable, communicative, and quick-thinking. A security guard that has these qualities will not only protect your property and people, but also enhance your reputation and credibility.</p>\n\n\t\t</div>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>[&hellip;]</p>","protected":false},"author":31,"featured_media":10001104,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":[],"categories":[6],"tags":[12,9,8,10],"class_list":["post","post-1104","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry"]}